rmany", "ES": "Spain", "FR": "France", "IT": "Italy", "NL": "Netherlands", "PL": "Poland"}}}, "time": {"label": "Time", "category": {"index": {"2019": 0, "2020": 1, "2021": 2, "2022": 3, "2023": 4, "2024": 5, "2025": 6}, "label": {"2019": "2019", "2020": "2020", "2021": "2021", "2022": "2022", "2023": "2023", "2024": "2024", "2025": "2025"}}}}, "extension": {"lang": "EN", "description": "<p>The Harmonised Index of Consumer Prices (HICP) measures price changes of various consumer goods and services over time (inflation). This dataset&nbsp;comprises:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li>the average index, which is the average of the monthly HICP indices in a calendar year, and&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>the annual average rate of change, which is the average of the monthly consumer price indices over a calendar year compared to the average of the monthly consumer price indices over the previous calendar year</li></ul><p>Please note that this dataset is discontinued and replaced by <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/bookmark/f7a8b7e0-9b0e-4652-a82b-ad4ffc058b1b?lang=en&amp;createdAt=2026-05-20T13:25:22Z\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">prc_hicp_ainr</a></p>", "id": "PRC_HICP_AIND", "agencyId": "ESTAT", "version": "1.0", "datastructure": {"id": "PRC_HICP_AIND", "agencyId": "ESTAT", "version": "59.0"}, "annotation": [{"type": "CREATED", "date": "2015-11-16T10:20:47+0100"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML", "title": "<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/PRC_HICP_AIND\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/PRC_HICP_AIND</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2